e remaining multiples of 3</p>\n<p>3) Colour in all the remaining multiples of 5</p>\n<p>4) Colour in all the remaining multiples of 7</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>The numbers that are left are prime numbers.</p>\n<p>There is a list of all the primes to 100 on the next activity.</p>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 142503144, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 7, "btnType": "SECONDARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "Finding Primes", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "DOWNLOAD", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 142497235, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": "Finding Primes-M-Lck12Tn6hdz0_MoIQ7Y.pdf", "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": "Printable Hundred Square", "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 142503595, "text": "9 counters arranged in groups of 3", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "Year 2 Counting in 3s groups of 3", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "Year 2 Counting in 3s groups of 3-NSow2e6cNkTWwDZltYMz-.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'he